[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22500.548, "timestamp": "06:15:00", "text": "我不想……呃，就像那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22502.548, "timestamp": "06:15:02", "text": "只是有点困惑而已。顺便说一下，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22505.35, "timestamp": "06:15:05", "text": "将根据他们有多少订阅者来决定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22513.35, "timestamp": "06:15:13", "text": "看。你也渴望成为一名职业人士。我知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22517.19, "timestamp": "06:15:17", "text": "兄弟。就像我确信，如果我拿走的话，你会让我拿走的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22518.29, "timestamp": "06:15:18", "text": "社交刀锋或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22519.788, "timestamp": "06:15:19", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22523.19, "timestamp": "06:15:23", "text": "比如，如果我确定我确实开始了的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22525.31, "timestamp": "06:15:25", "text": "这位有抱负的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22528.948, "timestamp": "06:15:28", "text": "就像jocknik那样的东西，对吧，呃，就像我做的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22532.39, "timestamp": "06:15:32", "text": "开始做这个有抱负的事情，比如 8 n"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22535.03, "timestamp": "06:15:35", "text": "几个月前的事了，我现在仍然深陷其中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22543.43, "timestamp": "06:15:43", "text": "我知道，如果我确定等等，婊子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22547.07, "timestamp": "06:15:47", "text": "正确的。抽搐。是的。如果我确定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22557.07, "timestamp": "06:15:57", "text": "年？等等，我该如何显示最后一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22559.31, "timestamp": "06:15:59", "text": "年"}]